{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzled Cube challenges your mind with a gripping, hands-on puzzle experience. Feel the thrill of unraveling complex patterns, the rush of each perfect move, and the satisfaction of mastering the cube. Stay focused, think ahead, and enjoy the journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/8c48bdc200a1b17ac10e928e3ffd8d6f.poster.avif?t=1757943298\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/8c48bdc200a1b17ac10e928e3ffd8d6f.webm?t=1757943298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/8c48bdc200a1b17ac10e928e3ffd8d6f.mp4?t=1757943298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Puzzled Cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzled Cube immerses you in a thrilling test of logic and strategy, where every turn brings you closer to solving the challenge. With each move, you\u2019ll feel the excitement of progress, the tension of near-misses, and the deep satisfaction of finding the perfect solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/a84bc11e7f6619ac9da61a73cee526cd.poster.avif?t=1757943298\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/a84bc11e7f6619ac9da61a73cee526cd.webm?t=1757943298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/a84bc11e7f6619ac9da61a73cee526cd.mp4?t=1757943298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp as you push your problem-solving skills to the limit. Whether you take a methodical approach or rely on quick thinking, every solved puzzle delivers a rewarding sense of mastery. Stay focused, stay determined, and conquer the cube!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587280?t=1757943298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587280?t=1757943298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/59917ce8fe3d5ccc8c1bff92dc9540c364dbac70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757943298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/59917ce8fe3d5ccc8c1bff92dc9540c364dbac70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757943298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Puzzled Cube</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/16c1ba6741f989cca6fe829a68d7c021.avif?t=1757943298\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzled Cube challenges your mind with a gripping, hands-on puzzle experience. Feel the thrill of unraveling complex patterns, the rush of each perfect move, and the satisfaction of mastering the cube. Stay focused, think ahead, and enjoy the journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587280/extras/8c48bdc200a1b17ac10e928e3ffd8d6f.poster.avif?t=1757943298\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://s